# Step 2: 8 becomes 0.
8,a,b,c,d,0

# Step 3: a neighbor is 8 (no transition of Table 2 has one).
# 0 and 1 become 8 when a neighbor is 2 to 7: with the 8 to the north, the other
# neighbor is to the east, the south or the west (rotations do the rest).
o,8,x,b,c,8
o,8,b,x,c,8
o,8,b,c,x,8
o,8,b,c,d,o
t,8,b,c,d,0
u,8,b,c,d,1

# Step 4: anything else. 0 stays 0 (no transition needed), 1 to 7 become 8.
v,a,b,c,d,8

@NAMES
0 background
1 core
2 sheath
3 left indicator, bonder, sprout generator, capper or finisher
4 gene (left turn), sprout guide
5 messenger
6 umbilical cord dissolver
7 gene (straight)
8 dissolving state
